      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "永昌王健完整一段以薨諡收束，緊接子仁，襲。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-weishu-weishou",
          "book_id": "b-weishu-weishou-017",
          "chapter_id": "c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang",
          "source_id": "s-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang-ws1550394",
          "paragraph_id": "c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p002",
          "quote": "永昌王健，泰常七年封。健姿貌魁壯，善弓馬，達兵法，所在征戰，常有大功。才藝比陳留桓王，而智略過之。從世祖破赫連昌，遂西略至木根山。討和龍，健別攻拔建德。後平叛胡白龍餘黨于西河。世祖襲蠕蠕，越涿邪山。車駕還，詔健殿後，蠕蠕萬騎追之，健與數十騎擊之，矢不虛發，所中皆應弦而斃，遂退。威震漠北。尋從平涼州，健功居多。又討破禿髮保周，自殺，傳首京師；復降沮渠無諱。無疾薨，諡曰莊王。",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p002:m0003"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-weishu-weishou",
          "book_id": "b-weishu-weishou-017",
          "chapter_id": "c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang",
          "source_id": "s-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang-ws1550394",
          "paragraph_id": "c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p003",
          "quote": "子仁，襲。仁亦驍勇，有父風，世祖奇之。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p003:m0001"
        }
      ],
